      {
        "name": "write_requirements",
        "args": {
          "content": "# Requirements — Bugfix: Eyedropper Saves Dark-Mode Colour in Dark Theme\n\n- **Run ID:** `20261106-120000-bugfix-eyedropper-dark-theme`\n- **Mode:** Brownfield\n- **Intent:** Bugfix (excalidraw/excalidraw#10867)\n\n---\n\n## In scope\n\n1. **`packages/common/src/colors.ts`**: Add and export a general inverse function for the dark-mode colour transform (`applyDarkModeFilter`) that converts an on-screen dark-mode colour back to its underlying scene colour (and returns the input colour unchanged when disabled).\n2. **`packages/common/src/colors.test.ts`** (and `packages/common/src/__snapshots__/colors.test.ts.snap` if touched): Add unit tests verifying the inverse transform and its round-trip properties (`applyDarkModeFilter(inverse(x)) === x` for on-screen colours in the transform's range, and `inverse(applyDarkModeFilter(c))` reproducing `c` exactly for `COLOR_PALETTE` colours and within rounding tolerance for arbitrary colours, plus alpha preservation).\n3. **`packages/excalidraw/components/EyeDropper.tsx`**: Update `getCurrentColor` to apply the dark-mode inverse when `appState.theme === THEME.DARK` so that `onChange` (live preview while pointer-dragging), `onSelect` (colour committed on `pointerup`), and `colorPreviewDiv.style.background` (which is styled with `filter: var(--theme-filter)` in `EyeDropper.scss`) all receive the underlying scene colour rather than the dark-filtered canvas pixel.\n4. **`packages/excalidraw/actions/actionProperties.tsx`**, **`packages/excalidraw/components/App.bucketFill.ts`**, **`packages/excalidraw/components/App.cursor.ts`**: Ensure all eyedropper consumers (stroke/background ColorPicker actions, bucket-fill `Alt` temporary eyedropper, and bucket-fill cursor colour) work seamlessly with the unconverted scene colour in both light and dark themes.\n5. **`packages/excalidraw/tests/eyeDropper.test.tsx`**: Add a reproducing jsdom test that picks a colour from the canvas in dark theme (failing before the fix and passing after) and verifies that light"
